.SH NAME
lean-apply - Apply an environment profile → .env


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBlean apply [profile] [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Resolve a profile (including inheritance) and write it to .env.
A backup of the current .env is taken before overwriting.

.PP
Inheritance is declared in the profile file:
  # lean:extends base
  # @extends base
  LEAN_EXTENDS=base


.SH OPTIONS
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for apply


.SH SEE ALSO
\fBlean(1)\fP


